      <pre style={{ background: '#f3f4f6', padding: 12, marginTop: 12, borderRadius: 6 }}>{`// Client entry (real app):\n// import { hydrateRoot } from 'react-dom/client';\n// hydrateRoot(document.getElementById('root'), <App />);\n//\n// hydrateRoot REUSES the server HTML.\n// createRoot(...).render(<App />) would THROW IT AWAY\n// and rebuild from scratch (no SSR benefit).`}</pre>
